Add --json to DrawThingsCLI models import

The dry-run and import paths both hold the finished Specification. The flag
prints it with the encoder settings appendCustomSpecification uses, plus
sortedKeys, so models import --dry-run --json prints exactly the custom.json
entry an import would append. With --json the summary table is not printed
and the dependency-download warning goes to stderr, so stdout is only JSON.
